  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void RegisterDataUpdateIndication (<a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::function</a>&lt; void(const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_InstanceSpecifier_4f5967.html\">ara::core::InstanceSpecifier</a> &amp;updatedStorage, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_StringView_cfeb8f.html\">ara::core::StringView</a> updatedElement)&gt; dataUpdateIndication, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_InstanceSpecifier_4f5967.html\">ara::core::InstanceSpecifier</a> monitoredStorage, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_core_Vector_53b788.html\">ara::core::Vector</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"ns_core_ara_core_e30e31.html#SWS_CORE_03001\">ara::core::String</a> &gt; monitored Elements) noexcept;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Registers a data update indication callback with Persistency. The provided callback function will be called by Persistency when an update of stored data happened. It will be called from the context of <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"ns_per_ara_per_d9a3e9.html#SWS_PER_00357\">ara::per::UpdatePersistency</a>, ara:: per::OpenKeyValueStorage, or <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"ns_per_ara_per_d9a3e9.html#SWS_PER_00116\">ara::per::OpenFileStorage</a>.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
  },
